  used is 30-43120-02.  Off-hand, I do not know if this is the power supply
  for this box -- but it is the power supply for some of the members of the
  Personal Workstation -au box series.

  The services materials for various -au boxes is are available at:

    http://h18002.www1.hp.com/alphaserver/workstations/retired/auseries/

